 once gosu is rebuilt against a newer Go, the version pin no longer matches\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 20) #     and every finding re-surfaces for re-evaluation (acts as an implicit expiry).\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 21) ignore:\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 22)   - vulnerability: CVE-2024-24790\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 23)     package: { name: stdlib, version: go1.22.2, location: \"/usr/sbin/gosu\" }\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 24)     reason: \"vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path: gosu (setuid exec shim) never calls the affected go1.22.2 stdlib subsystem; re-surfaces if gosu is rebuilt on a newer Go.\"\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 25)   - vulnerability: CVE-2024-24791\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 26)     package: { name: stdlib, version: go1.22.2, location: \"/usr/sbin/gosu\" }\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 27)     reason: \"vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path: gosu (setuid exec shim) never calls the affected go1.22.2 stdlib subsystem; re-surfaces if gosu is rebuilt on a newer Go.\"\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 28)   - vulnerability: CVE-2024-34156\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 29)     package: { name: stdlib, version: go1.22.2, location: \"/usr/sbin/gosu\" }\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 30)     reason: \"vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path: gosu (setuid exec shim) never calls the affected go1.22.2 stdlib subsystem; re-surfaces if gosu is rebuilt on a newer Go.\"\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 31)   - vulnerability: CVE-2024-34158\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 32)     package: { name: stdlib, version: go1.22.2, location: \"/usr/sbin/gosu\" }\n0ac0819414e (Mihailo Markovic 2026-07-07 12:20:31 +0200 33)  